3. Bira 91: Equity Financing
Background: Bira 91, a popular Indian craft beer company, was founded by Ankur Jain in 2015 with the goal of creating a premium beer experience in India. The brand’s distinctive packaging and marketing quickly caught the attention of younger Indian consumers.
